OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: experimental Multiview for up to four cameras, LEVEL roll and tilt meters with Double-tap Level, and Osmo Action 6 support (not yet checked on a real Action 6). Nano no longer shows zoom controls, clip delete in playback works again, and monitoring uses less power. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
